        {
          "question": "Can I apply for both the initial $300 and repeat $290 vouchers if I've never used this program?",
          "answer": "No, you must use the initial $300 voucher first, then wait approximately six months before you can reapply for the $290 repeat voucher. Each application is processed separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "What counts as emergency respite and how quickly can I get help?",
          "answer": "Emergency respite is available for crisis situations, but specific eligibility criteria and response times aren't detailed in program materials. Call 1-844-822-4622 immediately if you have an urgent caregiving crisis."
        },
        {
          "question": "Do I need to find my own respite care providers or will the program help?",
          "answer": "You can specify your preference for in-home agencies, adult day centers, or private caregivers on your application. The resource specialists at MAC Center can likely provide referrals to approved providers in your area."
        }
